{"id":30461,"date":"2023-08-31T08:35:07","date_gmt":"2023-08-31T08:35:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/?page_id=30461"},"modified":"2026-07-28T12:34:43","modified_gmt":"2026-07-28T12:34:43","slug":"kitchens","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/","title":{"rendered":"{{Kitchens}}"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\">[vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text cos_hidden_margin_bottom=\"true\"][\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_section content_placement=\"middle\" cos_section_fluid_container=\"container-fluid\" cos_section_margin_bottom=\"mb-xl\" cos_section_padding_top=\"pt-none\" cos_section_padding_bottom=\"pb-none\" el_class=\"header-espacios\" css=\".vc_custom_1612028503727{background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: contain !important;}\"][vc_row][vc_column][vc_section el_class=\" -6a82ba863dab2 cos-header-espacios\" content_placement=\"middle\" cos_section_fluid_container=\"container-fluid\" cos_section_margin_top=\"\" cos_section_margin_bottom=\"\" cos_section_padding_top=\"\" cos_section_padding_bottom=\"\" cos_background_type=\"\" cos_background_cut_in_tablet=\"\" cos_background_cut_in_responsive=\"\" cos_cut_height=\"\" cos_cut_color_superior=\"\" cos_cut_color_inferior=\"\" cos_background_image=\"\" ]\n\n[vc_row el_class =\"header_espacios_css\"]\n[vc_column]\n[vc_column_text el_class =\"header_espacios_title\"]<h1 class=\"dark-text-class\">Kitchen countertops <\/h1>[\/vc_column_text]\n[vc_column_text el_class =\"header_espacios_subtitle\"]<p class=\"dark-text-class\">Connecting the kitchen and living room<\/p>[\/vc_column_text]\n[\/vc_column]\n[\/vc_row]\n[\/vc_section]<style type=\"text\/css\" data-type=\"vc_shortcodes-custom-css\">.header_espacios_css:before{ background-image: url(https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/2560x1067-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&ixlib=php-3.3.0); opacity:1; }.cos-header-espacios{ background:#ffffff; }<\/style>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section cos_section_margin_top=\"mt-none\" cos_section_margin_bottom=\"mb-none\" cos_section_padding_top=\"pt-xl\" cos_section_padding_bottom=\"pb-xl\"][vc_row][vc_column width=\"5\/12\"][vc_column_text]\r\n<h2>Reinventing the kitchen to make it the heart of the home<\/h2>\r\n[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][vc_column width=\"7\/12\"][vc_column_text]The kitchen is no longer an afterthought in the home. it is now an important space that can integrate with the living-dining room and share the same design.\r\n\r\nIn this so-called \u201creconversion\u201d process, the island plays a major role, as it serves as a connecting element between the two environments as well as a meeting place in the home. In this project, the interior designer built the entire design around the island.\r\n[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section cos_section_margin_top=\"mt-none\" cos_section_margin_bottom=\"mb-none\"][vc_row][vc_column]\n    [vc_single_image\n        img_size=\"full\"\n        alignment=\"center \"\n        \n        image=\"104176\"\n        el_class=\"cos-single-img cos-single-img-6a82ba863c45f  auto_height_class cos-caption-right\"\n        add_caption=\"no\"\n        \n    ]\n\n    <div class=\" \"><\/div>\n    [\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section cos_section_margin_top=\"mt-xl\" cos_section_margin_bottom=\"mb-none\"][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1\/6\"][\/vc_column][vc_column width=\"2\/3\"][vc_column_text]\r\n<h2 class=\"h3\">Why are Cosentino materials perfect for kitchens?<\/h2>\r\nCosentino materials have properties that make their performance in the kitchen excellent: their high resistance to stains or scratches make Silestone and Dekton the ideal choice for millions of families to be part of their kitchen design.\r\n\r\nOne of the main advantages of Silestone and Dekton is that they have a wide range of colors that, together with their large format, allows us to create an unmatched visual continuity for our designs and adapt to any style. Countertops, fronts, cladding or floors, all in a single material, which minimizes joints and simplifies daily maintenance.[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1\/6\"][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section cos_section_margin_top=\"mt-none\" cos_section_padding_bottom=\"pb-none\"][vc_row cos_row_padding_bottom=\"pb-none\"][vc_column][vc_section el_class=\"cos-grid cos-grid-6a82ba863e569\" content_placement=\"middle\" cos_section_fluid_container=\"\" cos_section_margin_top=\"\" cos_section_margin_bottom=\"\" cos_section_padding_top=\"\" cos_section_padding_bottom=\"\" cos_background_type=\"\" cos_background_cut_in_tablet=\"\" cos_background_cut_in_responsive=\"\" cos_cut_height=\"\" cos_cut_color_superior=\"\" cos_cut_color_inferior=\"\" cos_background_image=\"\" ][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1\/1\" offset=\"vc_col-sm-12\"][vc_column_text]<h2 class=\"\">Cosentino: Surfaces and products for your kitchen<\/h2>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1\/3\" offset=\"vc_col-xs-6\" el_class=\"\" ]\n            <div class=\"card cosCard cosCard-nobg cos-grid-img h-100\">\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/kitchen-countertop\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-img-top  proportion-4-3\">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"338\" src=\"https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/600x451-%E2%80%93-2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=crop&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0&amp;max-h=338&amp;max-w=450\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\">    \n        <\/div>        \n    <\/div>\n\n        <\/a>  \n    \n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/kitchen-countertop\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-body card-body-justify\" >\n                <h3 class=\"h4 card-title\">Kitchen countertops <\/h3>                    <\/div>\n        <\/a>   \n    <\/div>[\/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1\/3\" offset=\"vc_col-xs-6\" el_class=\"\" ]\n            <div class=\"card cosCard cosCard-nobg cos-grid-img h-100\">\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/kitchen-flooring\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-img-top  proportion-4-3\">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"338\" src=\"https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/600x451.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=crop&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0&amp;max-h=338&amp;max-w=450\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\">    \n        <\/div>        \n    <\/div>\n\n        <\/a>  \n    \n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/kitchen-flooring\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-body card-body-justify\" >\n                <h3 class=\"h4 card-title\">Kitchen flooring<\/h3>                    <\/div>\n        <\/a>   \n    <\/div>[\/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1\/3\" offset=\"vc_col-xs-6\" el_class=\"\" ]\n            <div class=\"card cosCard cosCard-nobg cos-grid-img h-100\">\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/kitchen-claddings\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-img-top  proportion-4-3\">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"338\" src=\"https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/600x451-%E2%80%93-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=crop&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0&amp;max-h=338&amp;max-w=450\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\">    \n        <\/div>        \n    <\/div>\n\n        <\/a>  \n    \n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/kitchen-claddings\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-body card-body-justify\" >\n                <h3 class=\"h4 card-title\">Kitchen Cladding<\/h3>                    <\/div>\n        <\/a>   \n    <\/div>[\/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1\/3\" offset=\"vc_col-xs-6\" el_class=\"\" ]\n            <div class=\"card cosCard cosCard-nobg cos-grid-img h-100\">\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/kitchen-sinks\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-img-top  proportion-4-3\">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"338\" src=\"https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/600x451-%E2%80%93-4.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=crop&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0&amp;max-h=338&amp;max-w=450\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\">    \n        <\/div>        \n    <\/div>\n\n        <\/a>  \n    \n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/kitchen-sinks\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-body card-body-justify\" >\n                <h3 class=\"h4 card-title\">Kitchen sinks<\/h3>                    <\/div>\n        <\/a>   \n    <\/div>[\/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1\/3\" offset=\"vc_col-xs-6\" el_class=\"\" ]\n            <div class=\"card cosCard cosCard-nobg cos-grid-img h-100\">\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-img-top  proportion-4-3\">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"338\" src=\"https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/600x451-%E2%80%93-3.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=crop&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0&amp;max-h=338&amp;max-w=450\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\">    \n        <\/div>        \n    <\/div>\n\n        <\/a>  \n    \n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-body card-body-justify\" >\n                <h3 class=\"h4 card-title\">Kitchen Remodels<\/h3>                    <\/div>\n        <\/a>   \n    <\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section full_width=\"\" cos_section_padding_top=\"pt-none\" cos_section_padding_bottom=\"pb-none\"][vc_row][vc_column]<section class=\"cos-cta-2\">\n        <div class=\"row no-gutters\">\n         <div class=\"col-lg-6\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"cta-image img-fluid\" src=\"https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/cta-locator-img-black-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\">\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"cta-content col-lg-6 d-flex align-items-center\" style=\"background-image: url(https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/cta-locator-bg-black.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&ixlib=php-3.3.0); background-size: contain;\">\n                <div class=\"col-xl-9 cta-content-text  text-white\">\n                    <p class=\"h2\">Are you interested in a renovation?\n<\/p>\n                    <p class='lead '>We\u2019re here to help! Select from our network of certified professionals and they will be in touch to advise and give you personalized quotes.<\/p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/landings-usa\/quotation-form\/\" class=\"btn\" gtm-label=\"com_cta_solicita_presupuesto\">Request a quote<\/a>\n                <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n        <\/div><\/section>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section cos_section_margin_top=\"mt-none\" cos_section_margin_bottom=\"mb-xxxl\" cos_section_padding_top=\"pt-xl\"][vc_row][vc_column][vc_section el_class=\"cos-text-img cos-text-img-6a82ba863da0b cos-header-txt-img\" content_placement=\"middle\" cos_section_fluid_container=\"\" cos_section_margin_top=\"\" cos_section_margin_bottom=\"\" cos_section_padding_top=\"\" cos_section_padding_bottom=\"\" cos_background_type=\"\" cos_background_cut_in_tablet=\"\" cos_background_cut_in_responsive=\"\" cos_cut_height=\"\" cos_cut_color_superior=\"\" cos_cut_color_inferior=\"\" cos_background_image=\"\" ][vc_row content_placement=\"middle\"]\n                        [vc_column width=\"1\/2\" offset=\"vc_col-sm-push-6 vc_col-lg-offset-0 vc_col-sm-offset-0\" el_class=\"header-img img cos-caption-right \"]\n                            [vc_single_image image=\"104307\" el_class=\"\" add_caption=\"no\" img_size=\"large\"]\n                            \n                        [\/vc_column]\n                        [vc_column width=\"1\/2\" offset=\"vc_col-sm-pull-6 vc_col-sm-offset-0 vc_col-lg-5\" el_class=\"header-txt text  \"]\n                            [vc_column_text]\n                            <div class=\"text\">\n                                \r\n<h2>Silestone Integrity Kitchen Sinks<\/h2>\r\n<p class=\"lead\">No joints, no cracks, no limits. <\/p>\r\nMake your kitchen a single, unified space, where areas and surfaces flow continuously, without beginning or end.\r\n\r\nIntegrity offers a feeling of unity, of perfect integration with the rest of the elements of your countertop. A single piece designed in all the Silestone\u00ae colors to get an infinite kitchen.\n                                \n                            <\/div>                                \n                            [\/vc_column_text]\n                        [\/vc_column]\n                    [\/vc_row]\n                [\/vc_section][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section cos_section_margin_top=\"mt-none\" cos_section_margin_bottom=\"mb-none\" cos_section_padding_top=\"pt-xl\" cos_section_padding_bottom=\"pb-xl\" cos_background_type=\"background-color\" cos_cut_height=\"1-2\" cos_cut_color_superior=\"#e9e3df\" cos_cut_color_inferior=\"#e9e3df\"][vc_row][vc_column][vc_section el_class=\"cos-grid cos-grid-6a82ba863e569\" content_placement=\"middle\" cos_section_fluid_