 \n    \n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/elongated-personality\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-body card-body-justify\" >\n                <h3 class=\"h4 card-title\">09 \/ A kitchen full of character<\/h3>                    <\/div>\n        <\/a>   \n    <\/div>[\/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1\/3\" offset=\"vc_col-xs-6\" el_class=\"\" ]\n            <div class=\"card cosCard cosCard-nobg cos-grid-img h-100\">\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/contemporary-veining\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-img-top  proportion-4-3\">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"338\" src=\"https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/10-1-600x451-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=crop&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0&amp;max-h=338&amp;max-w=450\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\">    \n        <\/div>        \n    <\/div>\n\n        <\/a>  \n    \n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/contemporary-veining\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-body card-body-justify\" >\n                <h3 class=\"h4 card-title\">10 \/ Contemporary style in this kitchen featuring veins<\/h3>                    <\/div>\n        <\/a>   \n    <\/div>[\/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1\/3\" offset=\"vc_col-xs-6\" el_class=\"\" ]\n            <div class=\"card cosCard cosCard-nobg cos-grid-img h-100\">\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/order-connected-space\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-img-top  proportion-4-3\">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"338\" src=\"https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/11-2-600x451-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=crop&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0&amp;max-h=338&amp;max-w=450\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\">    \n        <\/div>        \n    <\/div>\n\n        <\/a>  \n    \n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/order-connected-space\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-body card-body-justify\" >\n                <h3 class=\"h4 card-title\">11 \/ Order and harmony in this stunning space connected to the rest of the house<\/h3>                    <\/div>\n        <\/a>   \n    <\/div>[\/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1\/3\" offset=\"vc_col-xs-6\" el_class=\"\" ]\n            <div class=\"card cosCard cosCard-nobg cos-grid-img h-100\">\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/cubic-lines\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-img-top  proportion-4-3\">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"338\" src=\"https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/12-1-600x451-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=crop&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0&amp;max-h=338&amp;max-w=450\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\">    \n        <\/div>        \n    <\/div>\n\n        <\/a>  \n    \n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/kitchens\/cubic-lines\/\" target='_self'  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-body card-body-justify\" >\n                <h3 class=\"h4 card-title\">12 \/ Cubic lines and a play of planes<\/h3>                    <\/div>\n        <\/a>   \n    <\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section cos_section_padding_top=\"pt-xl\"][vc_row cos_row_margin_bottom=\"mb-none\" cos_row_padding_bottom=\"pb-none\"][vc_column][vc_section el_class=\"cos-slider cos-slider-6a82ba863df9d cos-slider-cards cos-slider-cards-x4\" content_placement=\"middle\" cos_section_fluid_container=\"\" cos_section_margin_top=\"\" cos_section_margin_bottom=\"\" cos_section_padding_top=\"\" cos_section_padding_bottom=\"\" cos_background_type=\"\" cos_background_cut_in_tablet=\"\" cos_background_cut_in_responsive=\"\" cos_cut_height=\"\" cos_cut_color_superior=\"\" cos_cut_color_inferior=\"\" cos_background_image=\"\" ]<div class=\"cos-slider  \">[vc_row][vc_column column_absolute_carrusel=\"true\"][vc_column_text]<h2 class=\"width_100 h3\">Our brands<\/h2>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row content_placement=\"top\" row_active_carousel=\"true\" row_num_columns_desktop=\"4\" row_num_columns_tablet=\"2\" row_num_columns_mobile=\"1\" row_space_between_tablet=\"0\" row_space_between_mobile=\"0.25\" cos_custom_arrows=\"true\" cos_white_bullets=\"false\" cos_white_arrows=\"\" cos_slides_to_scroll=\"1\"][vc_column width=\"1\/4\" offset=\"vc_col-xs-6\"]\n            <div class=\"card cosCard cosCard-nobg cos-grid-img h-100\">\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/silestone\/\"  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-img-top \">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"255\" height=\"256\" src=\"https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/255x256-%E2%80%93-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\">    \n        <\/div>        \n    <\/div>\n\n        <\/a>  \n    \n    \n    <div class=\"card-body card-body-justify\" >\n        [vc_single_image image=\"74684\" img_size=\"medium\"]                            <p>Silestone is a hybrid surface of minerals and recycled materials which can bring colour and texture to your space. Thanks to its exclusive and innovative Hybriq+ technology, maintenance is minimal and high resistance to stains and scratches is guaranteed.<\/p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-4\">\n            <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/silestone\/\"   \" class=\"a-more-info\">More info<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"d-inline-block align-baseline ml-2\" src=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/themes\/cosentino-theme\/styles\/icons\/chevron-right.svg\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\"><\/a>      \n        <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n        [\/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1\/4\" offset=\"vc_col-xs-6\"]\n            <div class=\"card cosCard cosCard-nobg cos-grid-img h-100\">\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/dekton\/\"  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-img-top \">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"255\" height=\"256\" src=\"https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/255x256-%E2%80%93-2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\">    \n        <\/div>        \n    <\/div>\n\n        <\/a>  \n    \n    \n    <div class=\"card-body card-body-justify\" >\n        [vc_single_image image=\"85142\" img_size=\"medium\"]                            <p>Dekton is Cosentino\u2019s innovative ultra-compact surface, a technologically advanced material created by combining a sophisticated blend of minerals. It offers great strength and versatility, making it perfect for use in both residential applications and larger projects.<\/p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-4\">\n            <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/dekton\/\"   \" class=\"a-more-info\">More info<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"d-inline-block align-baseline ml-2\" src=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/themes\/cosentino-theme\/styles\/icons\/chevron-right.svg\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\"><\/a>      \n        <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n        [\/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1\/4\" offset=\"vc_col-xs-6\"]\n            <div class=\"card cosCard cosCard-nobg cos-grid-img h-100\">\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/sensa\/\"  >\n    \n    <div class=\"card-img-top \">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"255\" height=\"256\" src=\"https:\/\/imgix.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/255x256-%E2%80%93-3.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.0\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\">    \n        <\/div>        \n    <\/div>\n\n        <\/a>  \n    \n    \n    <div class=\"card-body card-body-justify\" >\n        [vc_single_image image=\"74745\" img_size=\"medium\"]                            <p>Sensa gives you the opportunity to enjoy natural stone without maintenance concerns. Its revolutionary stain treatment makes it durable for everyday use.<\/p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-4\">\n            <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/sensa\/\"   \" class=\"a-more-info\">More info<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"d-inline-block align-baseline ml-2\" src=\"https:\/\/www.cosentino.com\/usa\/wp-content\/themes\/cosentino-theme\/styles\/icons\/chevron-right.svg\" alt=\"Image of in Cosentino\" title=\"Image of - Cosentino\"><\/a>      \n        <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n        [\/vc_column][\/vc_row]<\/div><style type=\"text\/css\" data-type=\"vc_shortcodes-custom-css\">.title_slider_width{ width:100; }<\/style>[\/vc_section][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_row cos_row_margin_bottom=\"mb-l\"][vc_column][vc_section el_class=\"cos-cta-descargable newsletter c-cta-newsletter cos-cta-descargable newsletter c-cta-newsletter-6a82ba863dd1f\" content_placement=\"middle\" cos_section_fluid_container=\"\" cos_section_margin_top=\"\" cos_section_margin_bottom=\"\" cos_section_padding_top=\"pt-none\" cos_section_padding_bottom=\"\" cos_background_type=\"\" cos_background_cut_in_tablet=\"\" cos_background_cut_in_responsive=\"\" cos_cut_height=\"\" cos_cut_color_superior=\"\" cos_cut_color_inferior=\"\" cos_background_image=\"\" ]\n    [vc_row content_placement=\"middle\" el_class=\"\"]\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col